      "statement": "workshop-backend's build task is cache:false because FORMAT_BLUEPRINTS_DIR names a path outside the workspace: env declarations fingerprint the value, not the directory's contents, so caching would replay a stale generated format-blueprints module after edits under a fixed path.",
