    {
      "id": "claim_4afd7894c4624fffaee720f83703e826",
      "statement": "Configurator gatekeepers have no build script at all: build is a task running only tsc with dependsOn build:configurator, so the two cache separately and the env declaration actually applies to every invocation path.",
