      "id": "claim_9ab21ae99cc34968a80fcd8220780f78",
      "statement": "TypeScript 7 (tsgo) dropped the JS compiler API from its main export, so build-time transpilers needing it use the root typescript6 npm alias (typescript@6.0.3) while capnweb-validate ships its own capped compiler dependency.",
